  "description": "A source-faithful upper semicircle and hatched half-disk in one rectangular coordinate frame, used as the generating region in the sphere-volume proof. Radius is schematic; no answer or additional given data.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-188-six/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-188/tmp/g10-n68/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-g10-104.png",
      "sha256": "ee54a3ddb1c9eaace5b93b958f4162f1d5882c5b9c14dd912d062f9f794cc692"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s3-n68",
        "text": "§68. 球体的体积"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s3-n68",
        "text": "定理40. 计算半径是$R$的球体的体积的公式是：$V=\\frac{4}{3}\\pi R^3$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s3-n68",
        "text": "证明. 设已知一个以$O$为圆心，$|AB|=2R$为直径的半圆. 在半圆所在的平面内建立以$O$为原点、$OA$为横轴的直角坐标系（图104）. 半圆可以看成曲边梯形，它是由横轴及函数$y=\\sqrt{R^2-x^2}$的图象围成的."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s3-n68",
        "text": "图 104"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s3-n68",
        "text": "当已知半圆绕横轴旋转时，就得到球体. 利用求旋转图形的体积的公式（§66），求它的体积：$V=\\pi\\int_{-R}^Ry^2\\,dx=\\pi\\int_{-R}^R(R^2-x^2)\\,dx$ $=\\pi\\left(R^2x-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right)\\Big|_{-R}^R=\\frac{4}{3}\\pi R^3$. ■"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "104-semicircle-and-frame",
        "description": "One upper semicircle with its entire half-disk shaded by diagonal down-right hatching. A common horizontal x axis and vertical y axis meet at labelled O, the midpoint of the diameter. B is the left diameter endpoint, with a negative-R and zero coordinate tuple below it. A is the right endpoint, with a positive-R and zero tuple below it. Both endpoints are on the x axis; the top of the semicircle meets the y axis. The x line extends beyond both endpoints and is labelled x at the right. The y line extends through O, above the semicircle and a short distance below the diameter. Short positive-direction arrows are visible on the horizontal and vertical axes near O. Adjacent basis-vector glyphs have i-family and j-family roles. Comma tuple notation and explicit i/j arrow accents are modern role bindings, not exact source-glyph PASS. Exact radius and regular spacing are schematic author regularization.",
